  "stageId": "act5d0_08",
  "title": "11:41P.M.",
  "storyCode": "CB-8",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_08_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a268fd91502c9d200316c3bdf0ca282d5acee4370cc1bb2bfbcd66061d8c2f55",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "11:45 P.M. \\ Cloudy\nDowntown Lungmen, Cafe Al Fresco"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_035",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A pleasant aroma"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_035",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "To enjoy such a lovely al fresco cafe, with a sandwich, by candlelight, as the people go by, with the fragrance of sweet candy,"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_035",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It would be a truly relaxing experience were it not for this young lady staring daggers into me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_300_phenxi_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "portraitKey": "char_300_phenxi",
      "text": "...I just happened to be walking by. But that thing you have in your hand isn't the kind of thing that can be explained by happenstance."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_035",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I have explained. Mostima is acting in her capacity as an employee of Penguin Logistics, and I am helping her guard the staff in her absence."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_300_phenxi_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "portraitKey": "char_300_phenxi",
      "text": "You think I'm going to let some freak who talks to her staff off the hook?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_035",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "F- freak...? Let's just pretend you didn't see that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_300_phenxi_1",
      "operatorId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "portraitKey": "char_300_phenxi",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_035",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She will be fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_300_phenxi_1",
      "operatorId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "portraitKey": "char_300_phenxi",
      "text": "I'm not worried about her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_035",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Nor will she make trouble."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_300_phenxi_1",
      "operatorId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "portraitKey": "char_300_phenxi",
      "text": "...I hope you're right."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_035",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_300_phenxi_1",
      "operatorId": "char_300_phenxi",
      "portraitKey": "char_300_phenxi",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_035",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...... (Perhaps I should just stay in the hotel.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "char_213_mostma_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_213_mostma",
      "portraitKey": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "Oh, here you are. What was that back there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_034",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Just a flight of whimsy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "char_213_mostma_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_213_mostma",
      "portraitKey": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "Your whimsy might have been a little too powerful. You knew Penguin Logistics was there, didn't you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "char_213_mostma_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_213_mostma",
      "portraitKey": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "And as old as you are, you probably shouldn't exert yourself like that. You're not looking to cut it short, are you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_034#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Just how much of my power do you think I expended?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "char_213_mostma_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_213_mostma",
      "portraitKey": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "...right."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "char_213_mostma_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_213_mostma",
      "portraitKey": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "Well how about you take your murderous aura down a notch? I've had just about all the ominous energy I can take."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "char_213_mostma_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_213_mostma",
      "portraitKey": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "So what happened?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_034",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I may have underestimated the vigilance of the youth. Lungmen's young people never fail to impress me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_034#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It is nothing major, but a few out of control puppets have injured a remarkably dedicated finball master. That is all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "char_213_mostma_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_213_mostma",
      "portraitKey": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "'That is all?' I think you need to work on your expressions before you go saying things like that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_034#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The one who always smiles never truly smiles. Compared to you, I am very relaxed."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "char_213_mostma_1",
      "operatorId": "char_213_mostma",
      "portraitKey": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "Isn't this something you planned for?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "char_213_mostma_1",
      "operatorId": "char_213_mostma",
      "portraitKey": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "Like, in order to prevent this conflict between Penguin Logistics and the mob from turning sour, you went looking for an excuse to punish them? Something like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_034#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Look at you, girl. It's such a waste to have you scrounging around with that penguin."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "char_213_mostma_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_213_mostma",
      "portraitKey": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "I'll take that as a compliment."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_034",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...But I did not permit them to go trampling the slums. I would never permit that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_034",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I have reached the end of my patience for their constant oversteps, and yet they still continue to disregard the rules."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_034",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I had assumed that if they maintained even a faint connection to Siracusa, they might be of some miniscule, interesting benefit to Lungmen... I am very disappointed."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "char_213_mostma_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_213_mostma",
      "portraitKey": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "Wait a second... why are you telling me all of this? This isn't like a 'reveal your whole plan before killing me to keep your secrets' sort of thing, is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_034#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Old people need to complain."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "char_213_mostma_1",
      "operatorId": "char_213_mostma",
      "portraitKey": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "Oh yeah? Then I'll just treat it like a Sauin Carnival. I didn't hear a word you just said."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "char_213_mostma_1",
      "operatorId": "char_213_mostma",
      "portraitKey": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "The more trouble the mafia stirs up, the bigger the balance I'm due on the other side."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_034#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And after you have that money?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "char_213_mostma_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_213_mostma",
      "portraitKey": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "The first thing I'll do is buy that candy shop."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_034#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Heh. You really are attached."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_034#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Fine. Aside from the cellar, everything else is yours."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "char_213_mostma_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_213_mostma",
      "portraitKey": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "There's a cellar...? Can't you try to protect my sweet memories, even a little bit?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_034#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's my shop."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "char_213_mostma_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_213_mostma",
      "portraitKey": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "That's too bad. I really thought you'd retire as something more like a grocer."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_034#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Maybe. If I'm still alive by the time I retire."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_034#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Time grows short. The Carnival is about to begin. The players in this show are already in position."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "char_213_mostma_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_213_mostma",
      "portraitKey": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "You're not watching from the sidelines anymore?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_034#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...the scenery here is lovely, isn't it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_034#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sauin is all about honoring the dead. And Lungmen is our city, after all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_034#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "When the living enjoy their lively carousing, only then may the souls of the dead depart without regret."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_034#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And if we have a rat with one foot in a coffin, unless it moves, one might mistake it for a deceased soul ready to depart."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "char_213_mostma_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_213_mostma",
      "portraitKey": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "How are we supposed to do 'lively carousing?'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_034#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Just like this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "char_213_mostma_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_213_mostma",
      "portraitKey": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "Oh... I see."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "char_213_mostma_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_213_mostma",
      "portraitKey": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "Then this Sauin's expenses must be pretty high. Wasteful, even."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_034#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Smart girl."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "char_213_mostma_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_213_mostma",
      "portraitKey": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "Otherwise, Chief Wei would've come after you a long time ago."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_034#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Let's not speak of such matters. I certainly don't want to talk to the LGD again. So annoying."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_034#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But the key to a good show is when the actors foot the bill themselves."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "*Pant* *pant* Are those guys mobsters too? How much farther do we have to run?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "Definitely not. They might be some of those thugs we ran into before. There's too many of them. Don't want to think about it. Just run. We can lose them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "But I just saw a guy running at us with a rolling pin..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "That's how these fights usually go. You don't come to the slums often?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "Sometimes they end up rolling some blood or teeth into the dough, and then a customer gets all pissed off when he bites into somebody else's tooth."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "I really didn't need such a detailed explanation."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "...Have you known Mostima for a long time?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "You're getting pretty friendly with me now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "Mostima said she was testing me..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "Oh? I never heard about that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "...I guess I didn't either."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "Why do you look up to her so much? It's really different from the way you treat the rest of us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "She's kind of like... everything I ever hoped to be as a Messenger. She's done everything I ever hoped to do."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "...I really envy her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "Even though I don't really get what's going on in her head."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#8",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "That's how it goes. I chased her from Laterano to Lungmen, then I met the boss, and all the way up to today, I still don't know what's going on in her head."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#8",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "I've since given up. It's easier to just wait until she pops up right behind me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "Don't be so gloomy... Wait, did you say from Laterano to Lungmen?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "Uh huh. You caught that, did you? Don't give me that look. I'm just as good as Mostima. Maybe she's a little bit ahead, but..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "No, it really doesn't matter to me. We should focus on meeting up with Texas."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "Hrm."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "Hm."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd#5",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "Wasn't that a little too hard?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "That's justified self-defense. Don't sweat it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#8",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "Hey! Texas~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "You're okay. But where's Mostima?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "Do you really have to ask? She Mostima'd."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "Oh. Sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "What are you sorry about? And what are you all looking at me for?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "Ahaha... Mostima came back. We'll see her again sooner or later."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "But first, we should probably deal with these new bad guys..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd#4",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "So what's this all about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd#2",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "Some kinda revenge for us bein' too rowdy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "Maybe."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "Maybe?! Are the slums always this violent?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "Can't make friends if you don't throw down. Talkin' with yer fists is the oldest form of communication!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "Got a call. It's the boss."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What's crackin'?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You ladies havin' fun? Feel like you're missing something?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No? Good. Listen up."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "Mr. Emperor... did you happen to buy a lot of insurance?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "There's a big Carnival Gala down on Luk Low Street for Sauin tonight. They got some no-name marketing thing going on."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But I decided I'm gonna make an appearance there as your big time rap god."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We'll bring some fire beats to Lungmen. They break down in tears, and bow down all nice and tidy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "As for you, you're gonna watch my back. Then you scoop up all these wannabes chasin' us in one fell swoop."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Got it? Got it. Good. Make it happen."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "...He hung up."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "Feels like deja vu all over again."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "So I guess we have to go to that party thing too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "Yep. Let's hit the road!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
